Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不小心認真聽課了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞得我好睏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午上英語哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人你上週也忘了寫作業
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次有記得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 慘了 我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 來個人借我抄抄
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作業啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就像上週一樣找藉口說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「外星人用怪光線把作業本燒掉了」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 這招只能用一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外星人要是出現的這麼頻繁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任誰都會覺得不自然吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就把外星人換成關西人如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 原來如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關西人用怪光線把作業本燒掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是天才
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:05.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「不過為啥關西人會那麼恨我呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…會留下這麼一個疑問吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先再考量一下作業本被怪光線燒了這個設定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這倆傢伙真白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛剛說啥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「這倆傢伙真白癡」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 什麼叫「這倆傢伙」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:24.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別把本肌肉大人和那個萬年劍道服男混為一談
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:30.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少碰列儂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對貓咪施暴的混球連謙吾都不如
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如…謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你是恭介的妹妹我才一直對你手下留巾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過也到此為止了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手下留巾…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是想說「手下留情」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了 要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:02:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此 你們給他倆扔些能當武器的東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 你們想戰鬥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那鈴的武器就是貓了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指…指甲剪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罷了 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要給你剪至肉處
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你扯不開果汁罐的拉環
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥開始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先下手為強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:42.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用指甲剪剪掉了鈴的指甲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:46.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 剪得好深
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下你就扯不開拉環了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 待會兒給你們貓罐頭吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs21\pos(532,436)}monpeti
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:54.24,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs21}※monpeti 捏自實際存在的貓罐頭品牌mon petit 語源為法語 意為小可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:02:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有…有一手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:17.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慘了 課桌被撞出裂紋了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝者 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來你們不只是可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼根據規則 戰勝者給戰敗者真人一個稱號吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.18,0:03:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}真人獲得了「人渣」稱號!)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 我不要這種稱號!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人渣 麻煩幫我遞下醬汁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真…不對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人渣 你要蛋黃醬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:27.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 倒這麼多啊 真…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意見啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要用 動作快點 人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我受不了了!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就這麼喜歡欺負肌肉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喜歡就給你換個吧 蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丫剛叫我蠢蛋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢蛋是什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:06:02.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我剛剛發現這詞更傷人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:01.20,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:03.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綜上所述…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都說什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們Little Busters就更應該揮灑青春的汗水努力訓練了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:13.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…本想像這樣鼓舞一下士氣的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們應該沒忘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們人員還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人員啊 的確
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望有人能負責招集新成員進來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹有著拉小毬和來谷入隊的實績
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是最能勝任的人選
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千萬要找那種能立即參訓的能人來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:47.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能立即參訓的能人啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫無頭緒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜猜 我是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝葉留佳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 猜對了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈 理樹君 鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放學後散步中?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為啥摀住自己的眼睛杵在這兒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩猜猜我是誰遊戲唄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那遊戲的玩法是去摀住別人的眼睛啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別擺出一副生平第一次聽說的表情行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從剛剛開始就盼著有人經過這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果一個人也沒來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好 你們來了就算玩夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好一個人來瘋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒在誇你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.31,0:07:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走吧 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:50.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 三枝同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要來打打棒球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,綜上所述 我帶新成員來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 是葉留醬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 你還記得我說過的話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼來著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…我也忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈 人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別指我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先來個入隊測驗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.33,0:08:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼什麼 內容是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先是投捕球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打中哪裡得10分?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是打三振啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩真的!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是單純的相互投捕球啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 就是練投捕球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一開始就這麼說了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個自說自話的丫頭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葉留佳君 投過來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.35,0:09:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好棒好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葉留醬好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:27.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是 那丫頭到底在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,單人投捕球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶上這個試試
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左撇子用的棒球手套?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是左手投手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜對啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝葉留佳 總算找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.72,0:09:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是風紀委員的各位啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不接受罰掃就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然還搞出這種惡作劇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是惡作劇 是藝術作品啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:14.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是校長的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,風緊扯呼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光是本月就已經遲到了20次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚歸15次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罰掃也全部翹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 帶走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被 抓 到 啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:43.84,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,你再敢翹罰就把你從學校趕出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才沒翹 只是去一邊玩玩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:50.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懶蛋海豚…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.61,0:10:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好犀利的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說你邀請三枝同學加入Little Busters了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她本人有這個心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好說 希望她願意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:11.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒戲的啦 她就是一小滑頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你個人渣 瞧你幹的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.41,0:11:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:30.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會搞這種無聊惡作劇的只有你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀呀 諸位 早上好早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 問得好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我是來打探你們的近況的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,近況?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我幹的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這棒讀也太明顯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實是我昨天做惡作劇實驗時弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過等了半天都沒人來就膩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是忘了撤掉直接回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這丫頭絲毫沒有反省之色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到三枝葉留佳沒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她擅自把宿舍的水桶帶了出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是幹什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看到她了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒看到 你沒看到三枝葉留佳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著 為什麼要拉著我一起跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同甘共苦五里霧中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還可以拿你當人質哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落跑倒是挺快的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別想逃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘技 彈珠散射!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在 趕緊跑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 庫特
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧 庫特
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有事…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 直枝同學
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How are you,and I'm fine,thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那啥 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我趕路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:35.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該負的責任還是得負的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一會兒得去把彈珠回收了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是這麼鬧人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝葉留佳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:50.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩製造者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.33,0:13:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 委員長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她總是耍我們 很難對付
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.89,0:14:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫我們治治她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在得去學生會運營會議提交議案
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,處置鬧事者是你們的職責吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:12.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫什麼名字來著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直枝…理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎經常跟你那些顯眼的同伴們一起鬧事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天貌似就有張課桌在你們的打鬧中受損了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,損壞公物可是嚴重違反校規的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們正在討論該以何種形式勒令索賠 做好心理準備吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:36.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經自報姓名了 但你還沒告訴我你的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二木佳奈多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,記住了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二木佳奈多…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.77,0:14:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是位優秀的風紀委員
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佳奈多君啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可是以從不放水的風紀委員的名號發揮職能的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們會提出怎樣的受損課桌索賠方案呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這事莫非很嚴重?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,損壞那張課桌的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也多少有點責任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罷了 現在擔心這個也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始訓練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慘了 忘帶體操服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們先去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈 理樹君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桌子我估計能復原
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把真人弄壞的課桌修好了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害啊 你的手真巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好歹我也是個整備委員嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣確實還能用 所以應該不用賠償了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 大夥兒肯定也會很高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟我給大家添了不少麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種小事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來你還是在意這些的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過知道修好桌子的是我 二木佳奈多可能也不會認同
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:30.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想多了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:34.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒有 我這種人沒人信得過的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:38.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老是遲到 嘴裡出來的還全是謊話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謊話?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛 你猜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直很擅長那種活兒?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:50.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:17:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛才從自動售貨機裡用不正當手段取走果汁了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人目擊到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容我們確認一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用了什麼方法?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我今天的運氣好到詭異啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轉盤抽獎中了第二聽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才剛剛開始暗喜就發現又轉中了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後一共出來了四聽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰會相信你這個騙人精啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之你得跟我們走一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們冤枉我了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你們有在聽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 放開我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 二木同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼能一開始就持懷疑態度呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝同學不是會做這種事的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼啦 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你一直沒來大家都很擔心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這氣氛是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哪知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是直枝君吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這事跟你無關
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明沒有證據 僅憑對人家的印象就定罪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論以風紀委員長或是一個正常人的立場來談都過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可是曠課遲到的慣犯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是在撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就當她真中獎了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可在自動售貨機上中獎對那些老實付錢的人來說根本不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來就應該收手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 她又不付錢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們怎麼能容忍這種滑頭得到好處
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們非要堅持這種偏執也行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我付四聽果汁的錢就沒問題了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還差300圓…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:12.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們 有帶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是沒明白事情原委
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹說需要那就是需要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快給他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…這就有了320…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 一會兒我會還的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不堅持了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走 到巡邏時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:52.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別磨磨蹭蹭的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的處分保留到下次闖禍時吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傷腦筋呐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:14.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我說的都是謊話怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝同學沒有撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡惡作劇倒是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀 爛好人就是好騙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為啥這麼說 莫名其妙的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.53,0:20:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝到底犯啥事兒了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝同學她啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葉留醬她?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說決定加入Little Busters了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 要加入我們?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬歲!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們會傷透腦筋的 別怪我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就再來一次入隊測驗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝 戴上那只棒球手套有什麼感想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我聞到青春了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好極了 合格!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:23.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝從今天起就是Little Busters的一員了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 太好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是無所謂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:31.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進來個比我還蠢的 我的地位就飆升了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少說人家蠢 你個人渣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 你還這麼叫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就不叫人渣 叫蠢蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.88,0:21:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們到底什麼意思嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.05,0:21:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你們別這麼叫我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:22:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第7話\N猜猜 我是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:22:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第7話\N猜猜 我是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:22:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第7話\N猜猜 我是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要開始找室友了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:33.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 理樹成了庫狗狗的室友!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了我是男生啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務開始的說!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
